cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se usar o PRIVIO SENTRY em um trabalho, cite-o assim. / If you use PRIVIO SENTRY, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PRIVIO SENTRY: infraestrutura local de privacidade com IA (SENTRY Redact)"
abstract: >-
  Local-first pipeline that finds Brazilian CPF numbers and personal (residential) addresses in PDF files with
  Tesseract OCR, a YOLO signature detector and a local vision LLM served by Ollama, suggests redactions for
  human review in a web editor, verifies the output against the original and fails closed. It can support
  LGPD-aligned practices but does not guarantee anonymization.
authors:
  - alias: Yiuky
    name: "PRIVIO SENTRY contributors"
version: 5.0.0
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yiuky/privio-sentry"
url: "https://github.com/Yiuky/privio-sentry"
keywords:
  - privacy
  - redaction
  - LGPD
  - PDF
  - OCR
  - CPF
  - PII
  - local-first
